# Skyborne Starter (1-13): every quest of Zephras Isle, for both Skyborne races.
#
# Built into the addon with:  python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/skyborne_starter.guide
#
# Research (November 2026): the quests, their givers, objectives, prerequisites and the places of
# their mobs and objects come from the game data (data/forever.sqlite.zst: Questie, Wowhead, ATT),
# checked against https://outof.games/realms/forever/quests/zone/16593-zephras-isle/ (all 129 of its
# quests: the 7 it has that the data lacks are unused "DNT" quests or have no quest giver).
# Left out: The Ancient Hilt, Eluvi'ana and More Al'Aketh Ears (not in the game client), A Sacrifice
# in Vain (the alternative start of Unnerving Silence), the riding quests (level 40 and 60).
#
# The route: Thendal Grove (1-5), Shen'dar Village and the highlands (5-9), Valanaar and the
# Gustberry Lowlands (9-11), Shadowgale Forest (11-12), the assault on the Shrine of Akir (12-13).

guide Skyborne Starter (1-13)
map Zephras Isle
races 95 96
levels 1 13

